  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "For the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> to be continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></math><br /><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
